      "message": "At this point, why not introduce a parser\n```\nfn extract_resmem_entries(buffer: \u0026\u0027a [u8]) -\u003e Result\u003cVec\u003cConfigHeaderEntry\u003c\u0027a\u003e\u003e\u003e\n```\nand iterate through the `Vec` so that you don\u0027t need all this machinery and intermediate types (`ConfigHeader`)?",
